Use case: precise-object-edit. Create the production BACKGROUND TEXTURE of the approved course desk shown in reference. Keep all ten physical objects, their identities, luxurious warm wood/paper/materials, lighting and relative placement, but remove ALL application UI, sidebar, headlines, labels, callouts, Chinese writing, assistant character, buttons and progress bar. Output only the tabletop scene, wide landscape 1600x900 filling the image. Fixed high angled perspective, top rear of desktop at y=0, front edge at y=870. Do not invent other hero objects.
Layout normalized positions for clickable hotspots is REQUIRED:
envelope left-middle center (0.11,0.44), x .02-.23,y .32-.57;
small standing chalkboard upperleft center (.27,.25), x .18-.37,y .06-.43;
lavender projector uppermiddle center (.44,.23), x .37-.54,y .12-.36;
open book on stand upperright center (.72,.28), x .55-.88,y .04-.52;
question cards far right center (.92,.51), x .86-.99,y .39-.65;
wood stamp midright center (.78,.64), x .72-.84,y .53-.77;
brass desk bell lowright center (.82,.85), x .75-.88,y .77-.97;
pastel paper fan far lowright center (.93,.80), x .87-.99,y .68-.96;
clipboard lowerleft center (.15,.76), x .03-.29,y .59-.98;
central open ringbound lesson planner center (.49,.71), x .29-.70,y .48-.98.
Preserve fine rendered depth, rounded edges, woodgrain, individual book pages, metal rings, shadows. Planner pages have sparse faint rules and simple diagrams WITHOUT letters or words. Chalkboard has a simple chalk mountain drawing, question cards have one '?' symbol, all else no readable letters. Dark aubergine and warm wood palette matches reference, cream paper and lilac/orange stationery. No neon highlights, no outlines, no UI text. Scene must be handsome and ready to place real DOM buttons above.
